#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:6
msgid "Kconfig Reference"
msgstr "Kconfig 参考"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:8
msgid ""
"!!! note \"Document Status: PLANNED — Automatic generation system under "
"development\""
msgstr ""
"!!! note \"文档状态：PLANNED — 自动生成系统正在开发中\""

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:10
msgid ""
"The Kconfig Reference will be automatically extracted from "
"`Kconfig.build`, `Kconfig.chip`, and all `rsource` sub-files, providing a"
" complete list of Kconfig options."
msgstr ""
"Kconfig 参考将从 `Kconfig.build`、`Kconfig.chip` 以及所有 `rsource` 子文件中自动提取，提供完整的 Kconfig 选项列表。"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:12
msgid "Planned Content"
msgstr "计划内容"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:14
msgid "Name, type, and default value of each configuration option"
msgstr "每个配置选项的名称、类型和默认值"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:15
msgid "Dependencies (`depends on`, `select`)"
msgstr "依赖关系（`depends on`、`select`）"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:16
msgid "Value ranges (`range`, `choice`)"
msgstr "取值范围（`range`、`choice`）"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:17
msgid "Help text"
msgstr "帮助文本"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:18
msgid "Navigation organized by functional module"
msgstr "按功能模块组织的导航"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:20
msgid "Implementation Plan"
msgstr "实现计划"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:22
msgid ""
"Based on extending the existing `kconfig_parser.py`, reference "
"documentation in Markdown format will be automatically extracted from "
"Kconfig source files."
msgstr ""
"基于扩展现有的 `kconfig_parser.py`，将从 Kconfig 源文件中自动提取 Markdown 格式的参考文档。"

#: ../../source/kconfig_reference/index.md:24
msgid "The automatic generation system will be added later."
msgstr "自动生成系统将在后续添加。"
